pg_column_size 1,596) were stated without the query output. The read-only query and its output are now committed as snapshot-297-size-query.txt
(run 2026-09-13 19:18 +08, the same values). Correction, same finding set (finding 2): in step 3, "without traces 9,561" is the document with the
traces key removed (octet_length((results - 'traces')::text)), not 361,073 minus the traces value; 361,073 = 351,500 (traces value) + 9,561 + 12 (the
key and its separators, `, "traces": `).

Remediation 1, 2026-09-13 (validation of 1f57c75 failed C5; plans/2026-09-13-evaluation-evidence.md, Milestone 1)
Branch evaluation-evidence at 1f57c75 with the remediation in the working tree (committed with these files). Same machine and shell rules as above
(.env exported; `env | grep` for RAG_* and the application enable flags: 0 lines before every command). No chat model; no /api/recommendations call.
Changes: RetrievalEvaluationTraceLiveTests compares through TraceReproductionCheck (collects every differing question, every fallback with its trace
reason, every error, then every property mismatch against all 20 of 297's properties with trace the only exemption, and fails once);
TraceReproductionCheckTests exercises it over the committed snapshot 297 in verify; FilingReranker.reportsScores removed and FilingRetrievalService calls
rerankScored on both retrieve and retrieveTraced (default: rerank once, no order).

